{"color-variants":"<div class=\"grid gap-x-10 gap-y-6 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h5 class=\"text-base font-bold\">Color Variants</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400\">Track, thumb, border, text, and focus colors accept Tailwind color tokens.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><a href=\"https://github.com/goinfinite/ui/blob/main/src/form/toggleSwitch.templ\" rel=\"help noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"View Complete Component Settings\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-neutral-50 transition-all hover:opacity-80\">Usage <i class=\"ph-bold ph-arrow-square-out text-sm text-neutral-400\"></i></h4></a><pre class=\"rounded-md bg-neutral-800 p-4 text-xs text-wrap break-words tab-2\"><code>@uiForm.ToggleSwitch(uiForm.ToggleSwitchSettings{\n\tLabel:                       &#34;Emerald accent&#34;,\n\tTwoWayStatePath:             &#34;emeraldEnabled&#34;,\n\n\t// OptionalFields\n\tTrackBackgroundColor:        &#34;emerald-900/40&#34;,\n\tTrackCheckedBackgroundColor: &#34;emerald-500&#34;,\n\tThumbBackgroundColor:        &#34;amber-300&#34;,\n\tThumbBorderColor:            &#34;amber-500&#34;,\n\tTextColor:                   &#34;amber-100&#34;,\n\tFocusRingColor:              &#34;emerald-500/50&#34;,\n})</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"text-lg font-bold\">Live Example</p><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\" x-data=\"{emeraldEnabled: true, violetEnabled: false, amberEnabled: true}\"><!-- ToggleSwitch --><label class=\"inline-flex w-fit cursor-pointer select-none items-center gap-2 text-neutral-100 text-sm\"><input type=\"checkbox\" x-model=\"emeraldEnabled\" class=\"peer sr-only\"><div class=\"peer relative h-6 w-11 rounded-full bg-emerald-900/40 transition-colors peer-checked:bg-emerald-500 peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-emerald-500/50 after:absolute after:start-[2px] after:top-0.5 after:h-5 after:w-5 after:rounded-full after:border after:border-neutral-50/20 after:bg-white after:transition-all after:content-[&#39;&#39;] peer-checked:after:translate-x-full\"></div><span class=\"\">Emerald accent</span></label><!-- ToggleSwitch --><label class=\"inline-flex w-fit cursor-pointer select-none items-center gap-2 text-neutral-100 text-sm\"><input type=\"checkbox\" x-model=\"violetEnabled\" class=\"peer sr-only\"><div class=\"peer relative h-6 w-11 rounded-full bg-violet-900/40 transition-colors peer-checked:bg-violet-500 peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-violet-500/50 after:absolute after:start-[2px] after:top-0.5 after:h-5 after:w-5 after:rounded-full after:border after:border-neutral-50/20 after:bg-white after:transition-all after:content-[&#39;&#39;] peer-checked:after:translate-x-full\"></div><span class=\"\">Violet accent</span></label><!-- ToggleSwitch --><label class=\"inline-flex w-fit cursor-pointer select-none items-center gap-2 text-amber-100 text-sm\"><input type=\"checkbox\" x-model=\"amberEnabled\" class=\"peer sr-only\"><div class=\"peer relative h-6 w-11 rounded-full bg-red-500/20 transition-colors peer-checked:bg-amber-500 peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-amber-500/50 after:absolute after:start-[2px] after:top-0.5 after:h-5 after:w-5 after:rounded-full after:border after:border-amber-500 after:bg-amber-300 after:transition-all after:content-[&#39;&#39;] peer-checked:after:translate-x-full\"></div><span class=\"\">Amber thumb</span></label></div></div></div>","custom-values":"<div class=\"grid gap-x-10 gap-y-6 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h5 class=\"text-base font-bold\">Custom Values</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400\">CustomValue turns the switch into an array toggle: it adds the value when checked and removes it when unchecked. InputName includes the selection in form submission.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><a href=\"https://github.com/goinfinite/ui/blob/main/src/form/toggleSwitch.templ\" rel=\"help noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"View Complete Component Settings\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-neutral-50 transition-all hover:opacity-80\">Usage <i class=\"ph-bold ph-arrow-square-out text-sm text-neutral-400\"></i></h4></a><pre class=\"rounded-md bg-neutral-800 p-4 text-xs text-wrap break-words tab-2\"><code>@uiForm.ToggleSwitch(uiForm.ToggleSwitchSettings{\n\tLabel:           &#34;Email notifications&#34;,\n\tTwoWayStatePath: &#34;selectedChannels&#34;,\n\tInputName:       &#34;channels&#34;,\n\n\t// OptionalFields\n\tCustomValue: &#34;email&#34;,\n})</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"text-lg font-bold\">Live Example</p><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\" x-data=\"{selectedChannels: ['email']}\"><!-- ToggleSwitch --><label class=\"inline-flex w-fit cursor-pointer select-none items-center gap-2 text-neutral-100 text-sm\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"channels\" x-model=\"selectedChannels\" value=\"email\" class=\"peer sr-only\"><div class=\"peer relative h-6 w-11 rounded-full bg-neutral-50/10 transition-colors peer-checked:bg-secondary-500 peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-secondary-500/50 after:absolute after:start-[2px] after:top-0.5 after:h-5 after:w-5 after:rounded-full after:border after:border-neutral-50/20 after:bg-white after:transition-all after:content-[&#39;&#39;] peer-checked:after:translate-x-full\"></div><span class=\"\">Email notifications</span></label><!-- ToggleSwitch --><label class=\"inline-flex w-fit cursor-pointer select-none items-center gap-2 text-neutral-100 text-sm\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"channels\" x-model=\"selectedChannels\" value=\"sms\" class=\"peer sr-only\"><div class=\"peer relative h-6 w-11 rounded-full bg-neutral-50/10 transition-colors peer-checked:bg-secondary-500 peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-secondary-500/50 after:absolute after:start-[2px] after:top-0.5 after:h-5 after:w-5 after:rounded-full after:border after:border-neutral-50/20 after:bg-white after:transition-all after:content-[&#39;&#39;] peer-checked:after:translate-x-full\"></div><span class=\"\">SMS notifications</span></label><p class=\"mt-1.5 rounded-md border border-amber-400/30 bg-amber-400/10 p-3 font-mono text-xs text-amber-100 [text-box:trim-both_cap_alphabetic]\">Values: <span x-text=\"selectedChannels\"></span></p></div></div></div>","label-position":"<div class=\"grid gap-x-10 gap-y-6 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h5 class=\"text-base font-bold\">Label Position</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400\">LabelPosition places the label on the left or the right of the switch. TextCase transforms the label.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><a href=\"https://github.com/goinfinite/ui/blob/main/src/form/toggleSwitch.templ\" rel=\"help noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"View Complete Component Settings\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-neutral-50 transition-all hover:opacity-80\">Usage <i class=\"ph-bold ph-arrow-square-out text-sm text-neutral-400\"></i></h4></a><pre class=\"rounded-md bg-neutral-800 p-4 text-xs text-wrap break-words tab-2\"><code>@uiForm.ToggleSwitch(uiForm.ToggleSwitchSettings{\n\tLabel:           &#34;Enable notifications&#34;,\n\tTwoWayStatePath: &#34;isNotificationsEnabled&#34;,\n\n\t// OptionalFields\n\tLabelPosition: uiForm.ToggleSwitchLabelPositionLeft,\n\tTextCase:      uiToolset.TextCaseUpper,\n})</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"text-lg font-bold\">Live Example</p><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\" x-data=\"{isSizeExampleEnabled: false}\"><!-- ToggleSwitch --><label class=\"inline-flex w-fit cursor-pointer select-none items-center gap-2 text-neutral-100 text-sm\"><input type=\"checkbox\" x-model=\"isSizeExampleEnabled\" class=\"peer sr-only\"><div class=\"peer relative h-6 w-11 rounded-full bg-neutral-50/10 transition-colors peer-checked:bg-secondary-500 peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-secondary-500/50 after:absolute after:start-[2px] after:top-0.5 after:h-5 after:w-5 after:rounded-full after:border after:border-neutral-50/20 after:bg-white after:transition-all after:content-[&#39;&#39;] peer-checked:after:translate-x-full\"></div><span class=\"order-first uppercase\">Label on left</span></label><!-- ToggleSwitch --><label class=\"inline-flex w-fit cursor-pointer select-none items-center gap-2 text-neutral-100 text-sm\"><input type=\"checkbox\" x-model=\"isSizeExampleEnabled\" class=\"peer sr-only\"><div class=\"peer relative h-6 w-11 rounded-full bg-neutral-50/10 transition-colors peer-checked:bg-secondary-500 peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-secondary-500/50 after:absolute after:start-[2px] after:top-0.5 after:h-5 after:w-5 after:rounded-full after:border after:border-neutral-50/20 after:bg-white after:transition-all after:content-[&#39;&#39;] peer-checked:after:translate-x-full\"></div><span class=\" uppercase\">Label on right</span></label></div></div></div>","required-disabled":"<div class=\"grid gap-x-10 gap-y-6 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h5 class=\"text-base font-bold\">Required &amp; Disabled</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400\">IsRequired marks the switch as required. IsDisabled blocks edits.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><a href=\"https://github.com/goinfinite/ui/blob/main/src/form/toggleSwitch.templ\" rel=\"help noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"View Complete Component Settings\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-neutral-50 transition-all hover:opacity-80\">Usage <i class=\"ph-bold ph-arrow-square-out text-sm text-neutral-400\"></i></h4></a><pre class=\"rounded-md bg-neutral-800 p-4 text-xs text-wrap break-words tab-2\"><code>@uiForm.ToggleSwitch(uiForm.ToggleSwitchSettings{\n\tLabel:           &#34;Enable notifications&#34;,\n\tTwoWayStatePath: &#34;isNotificationsEnabled&#34;,\n\n\t// OptionalFields\n\tIsRequired: true,\n\tIsDisabled: false,\n})</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"text-lg font-bold\">Live Example</p><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\" x-data=\"{isRequiredExampleEnabled: false, isSizeExampleEnabled: false}\"><!-- ToggleSwitch --><label class=\"inline-flex w-fit cursor-pointer select-none items-center gap-2 text-neutral-100 text-sm\"><input type=\"checkbox\" x-model=\"isRequiredExampleEnabled\" required class=\"peer sr-only\"><div class=\"peer relative h-6 w-11 rounded-full bg-neutral-50/10 transition-colors peer-checked:bg-secondary-500 peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-secondary-500/50 after:absolute after:start-[2px] after:top-0.5 after:h-5 after:w-5 after:rounded-full after:border after:border-neutral-50/20 after:bg-white after:transition-all after:content-[&#39;&#39;] peer-checked:after:translate-x-full\"></div><span class=\"\">Required notifications<span class=\"text-red-700\">*</span></span></label><!-- ToggleSwitch --><label class=\"inline-flex w-fit cursor-not-allowed select-none items-center gap-2 opacity-50 text-neutral-100 text-sm\"><input type=\"checkbox\" x-model=\"isSizeExampleEnabled\" disabled class=\"peer sr-only\"><div class=\"peer relative h-6 w-11 rounded-full bg-neutral-50/10 transition-colors peer-checked:bg-secondary-500 peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-secondary-500/50 after:absolute after:start-[2px] after:top-0.5 after:h-5 after:w-5 after:rounded-full after:border after:border-neutral-50/20 after:bg-white after:transition-all after:content-[&#39;&#39;] peer-checked:after:translate-x-full\"></div><span class=\"\">Disabled</span></label></div></div></div>","sizes":"<div class=\"grid gap-x-10 gap-y-6 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h5 class=\"text-base font-bold\">Sizes</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-neutral-400\">Size scales the track, thumb, and label: xs, sm, md, lg, or xl.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\"><a href=\"https://github.com/goinfinite/ui/blob/main/src/form/toggleSwitch.templ\" rel=\"help noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"View Complete Component Settings\"><h4 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-neutral-50 transition-all hover:opacity-80\">Usage <i class=\"ph-bold ph-arrow-square-out text-sm text-neutral-400\"></i></h4></a><pre class=\"rounded-md bg-neutral-800 p-4 text-xs text-wrap break-words tab-2\"><code>@uiForm.ToggleSwitch(uiForm.ToggleSwitchSettings{\n\tLabel:           &#34;Enable notifications&#34;,\n\tTwoWayStatePath: &#34;isNotificationsEnabled&#34;,\n\n\t// OptionalFields\n\tSize: uiForm.ToggleSwitchSizeMd,\n})</code></pre></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"text-lg font-bold\">Live Example</p><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\" x-data=\"{isSizeExampleEnabled: false}\"><!-- ToggleSwitch --><label class=\"inline-flex w-fit cursor-pointer select-none items-center gap-2 text-neutral-100 text-xs\"><input type=\"checkbox\" x-model=\"isSizeExampleEnabled\" class=\"peer sr-only\"><div class=\"peer relative h-4 w-7 rounded-full bg-neutral-50/10 transition-colors peer-checked:bg-secondary-500 peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-secondary-500/50 after:absolute after:start-[2px] after:top-0.5 after:h-3 after:w-3 after:rounded-full after:border after:border-neutral-50/20 after:bg-white after:transition-all after:content-[&#39;&#39;] peer-checked:after:translate-x-full\"></div><span class=\"\">xs</span></label><!-- ToggleSwitch --><label class=\"inline-flex w-fit cursor-pointer select-none items-center gap-2 text-neutral-100 text-sm\"><input type=\"checkbox\" x-model=\"isSizeExampleEnabled\" class=\"peer sr-only\"><div class=\"peer relative h-5 w-9 rounded-full bg-neutral-50/10 transition-colors peer-checked:bg-secondary-500 peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-secondary-500/50 after:absolute after:start-[2px] after:top-0.5 after:h-4 after:w-4 after:roun